#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:7
msgid "C reimplementation of `seccomp-tools` with advanced features. We basically pronounce ceccomp in \"C-comp\" (/siːˈkɒmp/) or \"seccomp\" (/ˈsɛk.kɒmp/)."
msgstr "具有高级功能的对于 `seccomp-tools` 的 C 语言重新实现。我们基本上把 ceccomp 读作 “C-comp” (/siːˈkɒmp/) 或者 “seccomp” (/ˈsɛk.kɒmp/)。"

