#. type: Title #
#: ../README.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build"
msgstr "构建"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:51
msgid "Stable installation:"
msgstr "稳定版安装："

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Clone the whole repo, then run `./configure`. Dependencies will be detected automatically,\n"
"    please keep an eye on the output since components are automatically disabled if not available.\n"
"    For documentation generation, you need `asciidoctor`. For multi-language support, you need\n"
"    `gettext` package. For eBPF support, you need `libbpf` and `bpftool`. You could use\n"
"    `--without-doc`, `--without-i18n` and `--without-ebpf` to disable them explicitly.\n"
"    Please run `./configure --help` for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"    克隆整个仓库，然后运行 `./configure`。依赖会被自动检测，请小心输出结果，\n"
"    因为组件不可用时会被自动禁用。要生成文档，您需要 `asciidoctor`，要启用多语言支持，\n"
"    您需要 `gettext` 软件包。要启用 eBPF 支持，您需要 `libbpf` 和 `bpftool`。您可以使用\n"
"    `--without-doc`, `--without-i18n` 和 `--without-ebpf` 标志来显式禁用它们。\n"
"    请运行 `./configure --help` 查看详情。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # run this again if Makefile is not generated\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # install at /usr/local/bin\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # 如果 Makefile 没有生成就再运行一次\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # 安装在 /usr/local/bin\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:69
msgid "Testing installation:"
msgstr "测试版安装："

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Clone the whole repo, and then run `./configure --devmode`.\n"
msgstr "   克隆完整仓库，然后运行 `./configure --devmode`。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> To build this project or enable some features, the lowest denpendency version\n"
"> baselines are:\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.3, libseccomp >= 2.5.0 (exclude libbpf support)\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.11, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (global capture, only x86_64 guaranteed)\n"
"> * Linux >= 6.2, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (capture pid)\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 要想构建这个项目或启用某些特性，最低的依赖版本基线是：\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.3, libseccomp >= 2.5.0 (除了 libbpf 部分以外)\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.11, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (全局捕获，只保证 x86_64)\n"
"> * Linux >= 6.2, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (捕获 PID)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../README.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run Test"
msgstr "运行测试"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:90
msgid ""
"Run configure and make, then invoke `pytest test` from repo root. Trace pid case will be skipped if no CAP_SYS_ADMIN. If you find some checks failed, please submit an "
"issue to report your case."
msgstr ""
"运行 configure 后 make，然后再项目根目录下运行 `pytest test`。如果没有 CAP_SYS_ADMIN，追踪 pid 的测试案例会被跳过。如果您发现一些测试失败了，请开一个 issue 并上报您的案"
"例。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:93
msgid "To run the test, you need 2 extra packages: `pkgconf` (required by `pkg-config`) and `python-pytest` (required by `pytest`)."
msgstr "要想运行测试，您需要 2 个额外的软件包: `pkgconf` (被 `pkg-config` 需要) 和 `python-pytest` (被 `pytest` 需要)。"

